stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Off
  Off --> AwaitingAudio: User taps Start + permission + authenticated connection
  AwaitingAudio --> Listening: Microphone actually started
  AwaitingAudio --> Paused: Audio start failure
  Listening --> Listening: Silence but semantic turn incomplete
  Listening --> PendingTranscript: Semantic end or user presses Finish
  PendingTranscript --> SavingCheckpoint: Final transcript confirmed
  SavingCheckpoint --> Processing: Checkpoint saved / chained only submits then
  SavingCheckpoint --> Paused: Checkpoint write failed
  Processing --> Speaking: Local audio playback begins
  Speaking --> Listening: Confirmed barge-in stops spoken response
  Speaking --> Off: User ends session
  Listening --> Off: User ends session
  Paused --> AwaitingAudio: Explicit user restart
  Listening --> Paused: Network, route, permission or system interruption
  Speaking --> Paused: Network, route, permission or system interruption
